wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page_plug(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(32021039564597447775)
,p_plug_name=>'Interactive Grid Cookbook for APEX release 19.2'
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:t-Region--scrollBody'
,p_plug_template=>wwv_flow_imp.id(35108658789039181378)
,p_plug_display_sequence=>10
,p_include_in_reg_disp_sel_yn=>'Y'
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>This application demonstrates a number of advanced uses of Interactive Grid.',
'See the Notes region of each page for more information. In most cases there is',
'a lot of JavaScript and/or CSS code you will need to study to understand how',
'it works. Most of the examples/techniques are intended for developers with',
'intermediate to advanced skills with APEX and JavaScript.',
'</p>',
'<p><b>This application does NOT demonstrate best engineering practices. The ',
'intent is to show the raw APIs/techinques in their simplest form. As you adapt ',
'the code to fit your needs you should move it into plug-ins or separate files, ',
'use messages rather than hard coded strings, etc.</b>',
'</p>',
'<p>Although the JavaScript API documenation has been expanded to cover much of',
'Interactive Grid and related widgets and modules, some of these examples still',
'use APIs that are currently undocumented and unsupported.',
'They may become documented and supported in the future but still may change before then.',
'Applications using the techniques shown here may require changes to work with future ',
'releases of APEX. <b>Check the documentation</b>.',
'</p>',
'<p><b>This application requires that the Sample Interactive Grids app is installed',
'because it uses the same tables. It also installs function striphtml and table',
'IGCB_TASKS.</b>',
'</p>',
'<p>This app contains a Custom Popup item plug-in. See example page',
'<a href="f?p=&APP_ID.:24:&SESSION.">Rich Text and Custom Popup</a> and the',
'<a href="f?p=&APP_ID.:530:&SESSION.">Demo/Test</a> page. for details.</p>',
'<p>This app contains a Simple Grid region plug-in. See example page',
'<a href="f?p=&APP_ID.:31:&SESSION.">Simple Grid</a> for details.</p>',
'<h3>Change Log</h3>',
'<ul>',
'<li>6.0: New pages: UI Options, Avatar Cells, Auto Save, and Remember Page.<br>',
'Change example Update Selection to also add to the Actions > Selection menu.<br>',
'Change Always Edit to allow multiple selection now that it works in edit mode.<br>',
'Update styles on Spinner page.<br>',
'Fixes and improvements to the Edit in Dialog example; now works with cascade and PL/SQL DA actions.<br>',
'Change compatibility mode to 19.2 and update to latest Universal Theme.</li>',
'<li>5.0: New pages: Simple Cell Style, Simple Grid, Custom Progress,',
'Nested Table In Cell, Spark Chart Cell, Shared Model.',
'New plug-in Simple Grid. Change compatibility mode to 19.1 and upgrade to latest Universal Theme.',
'Minor wording fixes or improvements in notes. Use Close/Open Region DA where appropriate.',
'Use new declarative attributes where appropriate. Use new apex.util.getNestedObject in',
'JavaScript Initialization Code (pages: 4, 6, 12, 17, 18, 24, 29). Fix bug that causes',
'duplicate menu items (pages 9, 12, 11).',
'<br>Page 8: Icon view no longer needs advanced code for multiple selection.',
'<br>Page 18: Can now customize the createModelEditDialog OK button label. Use ',
'toolbarRemove to get rid of edit button. Disabling singleRowView no longer causes a problem.',
'<br>Page 20: Sorting works for icon and detail views now so add sort button.',
'Use declarative option to remove chart, flashback. Also disabling grid view now does work.',
'<br>Pages Page 25,26. Use template option Remove Body Padding. Use ',
'trackParentSelection and setMasterRecord rather than previous',
'hack using private methods.',
'<br>Page 29. The workaround for apex.message.confirm bug is no longer needed.',
'<li>4.0: Remove Copy to Clipboard example because now it is built-in. ',
'Update many examples to reflect changes and fixes that have been made.',
'Improvements to the "Tasks" (now with checkbox), "Rich Text and Custom Popup", and "IG Cards" examples.',
'New examples: Column Help, Wide Report, Master Detail Dialog (close/save), ',
'Lazy Tabs (page scroll/fit page), and Tabbed Record Editing. The Custom Popup ',
'plug-in has been updated with fixes and now supports multiple inputs and outputs.</li>',
'<li>3.0: Minor updates to notes mainly to remove mention of issues that have been resolved ',
'in 5.1.3 and 5.1.4. Added examples: Always Edit, and Rich Text and Custom Popup.</li>',
'<li>2.0: Added example Tasks (reorder)</li>',
'</ul>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
end;
/
