'<p>Originally asked on Twitter and then on the forums in this ',
'<a href=''https://community.oracle.com/message/14191346#14191346'' target=''_blank''>thread</a>',
'This is not a very complex example but in 5.1 there was a bug that kept it from ',
'working. The bug is fixed in 5.1.1. Also this shows improvements such as',
'the new toolbarFind method of the array returned by $.apex.interactiveGrid.copyDefaultToolbar().',
'</p>',
'<p>This is a non-editable grid but could just as easily be editable. This shows',
'the issue with Modern Star Rating plugin on a non-editable grid. See ',
'<a href=''f?p=&APP_ID.:3:&SESSION.''>Basic IG Report on EMP</a>',
'for a workaround.',
