begin
wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page(
 p_id=>8
,p_name=>'Custom Row Height with Image'
,p_step_title=>'Custom Row Height with Image'
,p_autocomplete_on_off=>'OFF'
,p_inline_css=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'/* ',
' As of 18.2 you can let the header labels wrap with the following custom CSS rule',
' and the header hight will be adjusted.',
' This automatic height adjustment works for labels with an explicit <br> in them ',
' as well.',
'*/',
'.a-GV-headerLabel {',
'    white-space: normal;',
'}',
'',
'/* You can still set an explicit height if you like but as of 18.2 you don''t need to',
'#emp .a-GV-header {',
'    height: 60px;',
'} */',
'/* ',
' Uncomment and show column ONLEAVE for an example where the heading is rotated so that it is vertical.',
' See the ONLEAVE column JavaScript init code for how the rotate class is applied.',
' NOTE this transform does not affect the measured heigh of the label and so ',
' the automatic height adjustment will not work as expected. This is a case',
' where you need to set an explicit height.',
'*/',
'/*',
'.rotate.a-GV-header {',
'    height: 120px;',
'}',
'.rotate .a-GV-headerLabel {',
'    transform: rotate(-90deg);',
'    display: block;',
'    white-space: nowrap;',
'}',
'*/',
'#emp .a-GV-cell {',
'    height: 142px;',
'}',
'/* by removing the height the edit fields will be centered */',
'#emp .a-GV-cell .a-GV-columnItem {',
'    height: auto;',
'}',
'/* uncomment to have notes edit in place',
'#C_NOTES {',
'    height: 128px;',
'    width: 100%;',
'} */',
'.wrap-cell {',
'    max-height: 128px;',
'    white-space: normal;',
'    overflow: hidden;',
'}',
'/* for icon view it is important to scope to a-TMV or something even more specific ',
'so that it doesn''t affect IG dialogs like chart. ''*/',
'#emp .a-IconList-item {',
'    width: 142px;',
'    height: 164px;',
'    text-align: center;',
'}',
'#emp .a-IconList-item .u-selector {',
'    position: absolute;',
'}',
'/* fix icon view styles */',
'.a-TMV .a-IconList-item.is-selected,',
'.a-TMV .a-IconList-item.is-selected.is-focused {',
'    background-color: #ecf3ff;',
'}',
'.a-TMV .a-IconList-item.is-focused {',
'   box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #4696fc inset, 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.1);',
'}',
''))
,p_page_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#'
,p_page_component_map=>'21'
);
wwv_flow_imp_page.create_page_plug(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(36812936328225206305)
,p_plug_name=>'Notes'
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:js-useLocalStorage:is-collapsed:t-Region--scrollBody'
,p_plug_template=>wwv_flow_imp.id(35108653483362181373)
,p_plug_display_sequence=>10
,p_include_in_reg_disp_sel_yn=>'Y'
,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>This page demonstrates how to change the default height of rows in the grid',
'view as well as having an icon column and putting the extra height to good use',
'for the Notes column. It also shows how to handle extra high column headings.',
'In this case the Employee Name column has an explicit &lt;br> so that it wraps.',
'A custom CSS rule lets the column headings wrap (see the JOB column).',
'As of 18.2 the grid will automatically adjust the height of the headers so ',
'that the frozen column rows stay aligned.',
'</p>',
'<p>This was asked in this <a href=''https://community.oracle.com/message/14161862#14161862'' target=''_blank''>thread</a>. ',
'See that thread for info about using blob columns etc. To keep this example',
'simple it is using old images that come with APEX.',
'This example shows how to customize the row height as described ',
'<a href=''http://hardlikesoftware.com/weblog/2017/01/06/interactive-grid-column-widths/'' target=''_blank''>here</a>.',
'A strange thing happens when the grid is also editable some controls that would ',
'be popups are not if they fit in the height but then they may not fit the width.',
'See the textarea Notes field for example. One way to deal with this is to make ',
'the height larger than the row (see width and height attributes). ',
'Another alternative is to use CSS to make it fix exactly (see inline CSS rule ',
'for #C_NOTES and uncomment). A drawback is that when in in navigation ',
'mode it would be nice if the text would wrap to fill available space. ',
'If you use the technique from the above blog using HTML Expression (&lt;div class="wrap-cell">&amp;NOTES.&lt;/div>) ',
'then it cannot be edited. This can be solved by using the advanced column',
'config property cellTemplate.',
'</p>',
'<p>This page also demonstrates a custom icon view using the same image. ',
'The default (non-custom) icon view sets a default height/width but requires a ',
'full URL for the image. The IMAGE column doesn''t have the full URL because it',
'would make the data larger. Custom icon markup is used to get around this. ',
'CSS rules are added to the page to set the height and width style. ',
'Starting in 19.1 icon view will pick up the selection settings from the Row Selector',
'column. This includes multiple selection and the checkbox (Hide Control).',
'</p>',
'<p>Demonstrates:<br>',
'Customizing IG CSS styles. New declarative Stretch attribute keeps the IMAGE column from',
'stretching (old Advanced configuration code is commented out).',
'Advanced configuration to set cellTemplate on the NOTES column so that it can be',
'edited and still show multiple lines in navigation mode. ',
'To see the automatic header height adjustment hide the',
'Employee Name column and adjust the width of the Employee Function column.',
'To see an example of vertical labels see the comments in the page inline CSS styles.',
'<br>Customizations:<br>',
'See Page attribute CSS: Inline. See Source SQL Query for how the IMAGE column is defined ',
'(note that by not defining the full URL it keeps the size of the data smaller).',
'See Column attribute Advanced: JavaScript Code for NOTES and IMAGE. See ',
'custom Icon view definition.',
'<br>Issues:<br>',
'The Icon view selection and focus styles need improvement; See fixes in CSS: Inline.<br>',
'</p>'))
,p_attributes=>wwv_flow_t_plugin_attributes(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
  'expand_shortcuts', 'N',
  'output_as', 'HTML')).to_clob
);
